# Docs and graph sync

Source code is canonical when docs and code disagree — fix docs/meaning in the same change.

After code changes:

1. Run `scripts/docs-impact.ps1` (see `.agents/skills/docs-impact`).
2. Run `scripts/graph-impact.ps1` (see `.agents/skills/graph-impact`).
3. Update required `docs/platform` / `docs/developer` files and `docs/product/graph` nodes/edges, or add a waiver under `docs/product/graph/waivers/`.

Roadmap may describe future behavior; do not present it as current implementation.
